# Business Document: Overview of Sports Operations

## Executive Summary
This document outlines the structure and operations of the sports division within Global Sports Management LLC (GSM), focusing on teams, leagues, venues, broadcasting, and sponsorships. It is designed to provide insight into the interrelationships between various entities involved in the sports industry, including stakeholders, processes, and financial implications.

